{"5021740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starworks Inc.", "steam_appid": 5021740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The human race is in danger. The rapid expansion of human colonies into the star systems near Earth has provoked the wrath of our stellar neighbors. War has raged ever since, and humanity is struggling to emerge victorious.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the commander of a newly created starbase, your task is to support the human war effort by mining resources from your assigned system and help us win this war of annihilation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploit resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Sun's energy to the gas giant's hydrogen, collect as many resources as possible, harness the resources of an entire solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these resources to upgrade your operations, add more harvesters or improve their working efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/2f193fa7b28a572911c3a19a0012fc2b.poster.avif?t=1788273283\" width=1000 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/2f193fa7b28a572911c3a19a0012fc2b.webm?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/2f193fa7b28a572911c3a19a0012fc2b.mp4?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize your productions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing runs better than something with a human in command !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take manual control of your operations : point your solar panels towards the star, overclock your foundries, and watch your operations get a boost to their production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/c82a3f8c786b34665d34c855f7476038.poster.avif?t=1788273283\" width=766 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/c82a3f8c786b34665d34c855f7476038.webm?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/c82a3f8c786b34665d34c855f7476038.mp4?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock new technologies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve all operations exploiting the same resource or improve your research capacities to unlock even better technologies !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase yield when transforming resources, boost spaceship production and research unknown materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/1b49422f86a542f97a4f65b0a1c1c7f8.poster.avif?t=1788273283\" width=800 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/1b49422f86a542f97a4f65b0a1c1c7f8.webm?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/1b49422f86a542f97a4f65b0a1c1c7f8.mp4?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead humanity to victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your sector is left in peace, the same cannot be said for the rest of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify existing positions, take back lost territory, and use your newly built spaceships to push your offensives into the heart of the invaders' territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features in the full game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit the resources of a solar system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize productions by playing mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform base resources into more advanced ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Interstellar map to send military offensives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring peace to the stars !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No generative AI was used while making this game.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The human race is in danger. The rapid expansion of human colonies into the star systems near Earth has provoked the wrath of our stellar neighbors. War has raged ever since, and humanity is struggling to emerge victorious.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the commander of a newly created starbase, your task is to support the human war effort by mining resources from your assigned system and help us win this war of annihilation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploit resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Sun's energy to the gas giant's hydrogen, collect as many resources as possible, harness the resources of an entire solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these resources to upgrade your operations, add more harvesters or improve their working efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/2f193fa7b28a572911c3a19a0012fc2b.poster.avif?t=1788273283\" width=1000 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/2f193fa7b28a572911c3a19a0012fc2b.webm?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/2f193fa7b28a572911c3a19a0012fc2b.mp4?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optimize your productions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing runs better than something with a human in command !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take manual control of your operations : point your solar panels towards the star, overclock your foundries, and watch your operations get a boost to their production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/c82a3f8c786b34665d34c855f7476038.poster.avif?t=1788273283\" width=766 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/c82a3f8c786b34665d34c855f7476038.webm?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/c82a3f8c786b34665d34c855f7476038.mp4?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock new technologies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve all operations exploiting the same resource or improve your research capacities to unlock even better technologies !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase yield when transforming resources, boost spaceship production and research unknown materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/1b49422f86a542f97a4f65b0a1c1c7f8.poster.avif?t=1788273283\" width=800 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/1b49422f86a542f97a4f65b0a1c1c7f8.webm?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/extras/1b49422f86a542f97a4f65b0a1c1c7f8.mp4?t=1788273283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead humanity to victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your sector is left in peace, the same cannot be said for the rest of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify existing positions, take back lost territory, and use your newly built spaceships to push your offensives into the heart of the invaders' territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features in the full game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit the resources of a solar system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize productions by playing mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform base resources into more advanced ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Interstellar map to send military offensives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring peace to the stars !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No generative AI was used while making this game.</i></p>", "short_description": "Harness the riches of a star system in this incremental idle game. Unlock new technologies, transform raw materials, build warships and win an interstellar war !", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5021740/e64db4cc7dbaf85a7009d03172489ef421d79a98/header.jpg?t=1788273283", "capsul